      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "Section 23 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by inserting in subsection (1A) \"or a copy of it\" after \"retain\nthe record\";\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (No. 2)\nNo. 123, 1991\n(b) by inserting in paragraphs (2) (a) and (b) \"or a copy of it\" after\n\"retain the record\";\n(c) by omitting from paragraph (2) (ba) \", together with any record\"\nand substituting \"or a copy of it, together with any record, or\ncopy of any record,\";\n(d) by inserting in paragraph (2) (c) \"or a copy of it\" after \"retain\nthe record\".\nAccess to CTR information",
      "skos:definition": "Section 23 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by inserting in subsection (1A) \"or a copy of it\" after \"retain\nthe record\";\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (No. 2)\nNo. 123, 1991\n(b) by inserting in paragraphs (2) (a) and (b) \"or a copy of it\" after\n\"retain the record\";\n(c) by omitting from paragraph (2) (ba) \", together with any record\"\nand substituting \"or a copy of it, together with any record, or\ncopy of any record,\";\n(d) by inserting in paragraph (2) (c) \"or a copy of it\" after \"retain\nthe record\".\nAccess to CTR information",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-14-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-14-logic-deontic-1"
