      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "Section 38 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by omitting from paragraph (1) (c) \"and\";\n(b) by adding at the end of subsection (1) the following word and\nparagraph:\n\"and (e) to issue guidelines to cash dealers about their\nobligations under this Act and the regulations.\".",
      "skos:definition": "Section 38 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by omitting from paragraph (1) (c) \"and\";\n(b) by adding at the end of subsection (1) the following word and\nparagraph:\n\"and (e) to issue guidelines to cash dealers about their\nobligations under this Act and the regulations.\".",
