    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-24",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "24 Section 24",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-act#sec-24"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf, p.11",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Section 18 of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the\nend of subsection (1) \"and to the evidence given in any such\nproceedings\".\n(2) The amendment made by subsection (1) applies in relation to\nan application made under subsection 17 (1) of the Principal Act after\nthe commencement of this section in respect of a person's conviction\nof an offence, whether the person was convicted before or after the\ncommencement.\nNotice of application for restraining order",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Section 18 of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the\nend of subsection (1) \"and to the evidence given in any such\nproceedings\".\n(2) The amendment made by subsection (1) applies in relation to\nan application made under subsection 17 (1) of the Principal Act after\nthe commencement of this section in respect of a person's conviction\nof an offence, whether the person was convicted before or after the\ncommencement.\nNotice of application for restraining order",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-24-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-24-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e1352aa6d9de522cb136f4e4927b8e245b54cfbafb0c83e4800a34061b3203af"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-act#sec-24",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "24 Section 24",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 11,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Section 18 of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the\nend of subsection (1) \"and to the evidence given in any such\nproceedings\".\n(2) The amendment made by subsection (1) applies in relation to\nan application made under subsection 17 (1) of the Principal Act after\nthe commencement of this section in respect of a person's conviction\nof an offence, whether the person was convicted before or after the\ncommencement.\nNotice of application for restraining order"
    },
