    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-39",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "39 Section 39",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-act#sec-39"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "Section 7B of the Principal Act is amended by omitting\nparagraph (b) and substituting the following paragraph:\n\"(b) the authorized officer has reason to believe that the person is\nrequired to remain in Australia or to refrain from applying for,\nor obtaining, an Australian passport:\n(i) by order of a court made under a law of the\nCommonwealth or of a State or Territory; or\n(ii) under a condition of parole or of a recognizance, surety\nor bail bond; or\n(iii) under a condition specified in a licence granted under\nsection 19AP of the Crimes Act 1914 or in any similar\ninstrument of early release granted or issued under a law\nof a State or Territory.\".",
      "skos:definition": "Section 7B of the Principal Act is amended by omitting\nparagraph (b) and substituting the following paragraph:\n\"(b) the authorized officer has reason to believe that the person is\nrequired to remain in Australia or to refrain from applying for,\nor obtaining, an Australian passport:\n(i) by order of a court made under a law of the\nCommonwealth or of a State or Territory; or\n(ii) under a condition of parole or of a recognizance, surety\nor bail bond; or\n(iii) under a condition specified in a licence granted under\nsection 19AP of the Crimes Act 1914 or in any similar\ninstrument of early release granted or issued under a law\nof a State or Territory.\".",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-39-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-39-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2bc6ebadc17248e02c883a3a725a8a2b4bbe345af301984cd41723ade03d1ae0",
      "skos:note": "Prohibition on leaving Australia or applying for an Australian passport without permission."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-act#sec-39",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "39 Section 39",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 16,
      "values:originalText": "Section 7B of the Principal Act is amended by omitting\nparagraph (b) and substituting the following paragraph:\n\"(b) the authorized officer has reason to believe that the person is\nrequired to remain in Australia or to refrain from applying for,\nor obtaining, an Australian passport:\n(i) by order of a court made under a law of the\nCommonwealth or of a State or Territory; or\n(ii) under a condition of parole or of a recognizance, surety\nor bail bond; or\n(iii) under a condition specified in a licence granted under\nsection 19AP of the Crimes Act 1914 or in any similar\ninstrument of early release granted or issued under a law\nof a State or Territory.\"."
    },
