    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-41",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41 Section 41",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-act#sec-41"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Section 18 of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the\nend of subsection (1) \"and to the evidence given in any such\nproceeding\".\n(2) The amendment made by subsection (1) applies in relation to\nan application made under subsection 14 (1) of the Principal Act after\nthe commencement of this section for a confiscation order in respect\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (No. 2)\nNo. 123, 1991\nof a person's conviction, whether the person was convicted before or\nafter that commencement.\nAssessment of pecuniary penalty",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Section 18 of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the\nend of subsection (1) \"and to the evidence given in any such\nproceeding\".\n(2) The amendment made by subsection (1) applies in relation to\nan application made under subsection 14 (1) of the Principal Act after\nthe commencement of this section for a confiscation order in respect\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (No. 2)\nNo. 123, 1991\nof a person's conviction, whether the person was convicted before or\nafter that commencement.\nAssessment of pecuniary penalty",
