      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "The amendments made by sections 45 and 46 do not apply to\nan application made under subsection 45 (3) of the Principal Act before\nthe commencement of this section.\nCourt may make further orders",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments made by sections 45 and 46 do not apply to\nan application made under subsection 45 (3) of the Principal Act before\nthe commencement of this section.\nCourt may make further orders",
