      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf, p.21",
      "values:originalText": "Section 66 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by omitting from paragraph (1) (d) \"and\";\n(b) by omitting paragraph (e).\nState and Territory courts to have jurisdiction",
      "skos:definition": "Section 66 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by omitting from paragraph (1) (d) \"and\";\n(b) by omitting paragraph (e).\nState and Territory courts to have jurisdiction",
